    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Enjoy a\nROMAN\nHOLIDAY\non your way to New York\nPIA\nGreat people to Fly with\n→ Pid office\nInsist on\nPIA\nwhen you fly\nto\nFRANKFURT\nA MODERN CITY WITH\nA GLORIOUS PAST\nStopover at Frankfurt on your way to London by\nPIA's Boeing 720-B. This big, comfortable plane\nleaves Karachi every Tuesday at 9 A.M. and every\nThursday at 11.59 P.M. On the way, in addition\nto its now famous service PIA provides cinema on\nboard to both Economy and First Class passengers.\nPIA is the only airline that does this. If you are\nplanning a trip to Frankfurt insist on flying PIA.\nPIA\nGreat people to Fly with-\n8199:2\nEffective\nMay 4, 1962\n3\nFLIGHTS\nWEEKLY\nTO NEW\nYORK\nPIA-\nGreat people to Fly with",
      "PIA-\nAIR BUS SERVICES IN\nWEST PAKISTAN\nEFFECTIVE 4TH MAY, 1962\nWe.\nSu.\n634\nF 27\nDays\nFlight No. PK.\nAircraft\nClass\nWe. Su.\n635\nF 27\n15.10\ndep\nPESHAWAR\narr\n17.10\n15.55\narr\nCHITRAL\ndep\n16.25\nF-27—Fokker Friendship\nT-Tourist.\nALL LOCAL TIMES\nFARES\nFrom/To\nOne Way\nRound Trip\nExcess\nBaggage \u0026\nCargo\nRates\nper lo.\nPESHAWAR\nChitral\nCHITRAL\nPeshawar\n47.00\nRupees\n94.00\n0.30\n47.00\n94.00\n0.20\nWe. Fr.\nSu.\n624\nF 27\nEFFECTIVE IST JUNE, 1962\nDaily Ex.\nDays\nDaily Ex.\nMo. Tu.\nMo. Tu.\n626\nFlight No. PK.\nF 27\nAircraft\n627\nClass\nF 27\nWe. Fr.\nSu.\n625\nF 27\n06.00\n10.35\ndep RAWALPINDI arr\n13.35\n09.35\n11.35\narr\nGILGIT\ndep\n12.35\n07.20\narr\nSKARDU\ndep\n08.20\nF-27—Fokker Friendship\nT-Tourist.\nALL LOCAL TIMES\nFARES\nFrom/To\nOne Way\nExcess Bagagge\n\u0026 Cargo Rates\nper lb.\nRAWALPINDI\nGilgit\nSkardu\nGILGIT\nRawalpindi\nSKARDU\nRawalpindi\n65.00\n78.00\nRupees\n0.40\n0.45\n65.00\n0.25\n78.00\n0.30\n1. Due to uncertain weather conditions prevailing in this area it may not be\npossible to maintain the above schedule.\nNo Hotel Accommodation will\nbe provided to the passengers in the event of delays or cancellation of\nflights.\n2. Applicable student rebate will be allowed to local students.\n3. Easy connection is available to Karachi passengers for Gilgit at Rawalpindi.\n2005.132.089.0026"
    ],
